@host = http://localhost:5094

### Customer login (C001, C002 or C003 - password pass123)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C003", "password": "pass123" }

### Staff login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff@nwsdb.lk", "password": "staff123" }

### Partner login (this is exactly what QuickPay.PartnerApp does with its API key)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/partner/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partnerId": "P001", "apiKey": "pk_quickpay_001" }

### Paste the token from a login response below to try the protected endpoints
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### C003's current bill
GET {{host}}/api/bill/customer/C003/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C003's water usage
GET {{host}}/api/waterusage/customer/C003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
